e milkjug thing again?\"], [\"Could you tell me when my milkjug thing is, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0021\", \"v\": [[\"um what milkjug stuff have I, uh, got?\", \"oh and can I get the, the home wifi details?\", \"and the actual… like the password itself?\"], [\"I'm trying to tidy up everything related to it in one go, so what milkjug things do I have in here?\", \"Separate thing — I've got a new laptop that needs connecting, so can you pull up the home wifi details?\", \"That's just the entry though, and I need to actually type it in, so what's the password?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0022\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me who I still need to pay back, please?\", \"Thank you. Regarding Mahala, when did we last speak?\", \"Would you please jot down a note that says ideas for the shutter?\"], [\"um who do I still have to, uh, pay back?\", \"ok and Mahala — when did we, um, last talk?\", \"oh and can you jot down a note saying ideas for the shutter\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0023\", \"v\": [[\"any parasol events on my calendar\", \"i texted Kofi, log it pls\", \"the Fenwick one\", \"what events r they coming to\", \"whos coming to it\"], [\"umm do I have any, uh, parasol events in my diary?\", \"oh, I texted Kofi — can you log that?\", \"uh, Fenwick, it was Fenwick\", \"ok and what events are they, um, coming to?\", \"and who's coming to that one?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0024\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me which steps of the lido job are still open, please?\", \"Thank you — how many is that?\"], [\"I promised myself I'd wrap that project up soon, so which steps of the lido job are still outstanding?\", \"Hmm, that's fewer than I feared actually — how many is that altogether?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0025\", \"v\": [[\"um who's gonna be at the, uh, the pick?\"], [\"who's at the pick?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0026\", \"v\": [[\"umm which of my tasks don't have, like, a due date?\", \"ok can you delete the, uh, the sort one\", \"oh and um move the kintsugi task to saturday and the Jalhaven one to next monday\"], [\"which tasks have no due date\", \"delete the sort one pls\", \"move the kintsugi task to saturday and the Jalhaven one to next monday thx\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0027\", \"v\": [[\"list items on prism?\"], [\"I'm working through my lists and can't remember what I put down, so could you find the list items on prism for me?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0028\", \"v\": [[\"I hate having debts hanging around, so can you settle up with Maricel in the Damdale house share?\", \"Also my notes are a total mess — could you clear out the things notes?\"], [\"Would you please settle up with Maricel in the Damdale house share?\", \"Could you also clear out the things notes, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0029\", \"v\": [[\"add eleven pounds, Maricel's petrol, Damdale house share — I paid\", \"coffee with Ysolde Leby — log it\", \"Raffaella Ramsay owe me in salmon collective?\", \"wait — pics I took recently?\", \"who's invited to the chiropodist?\"], [\"add eleven pounds for Maricel's petrol to Damdale house share, i paid\", \"had a coffee w Ysolde Leby, log it pls\", \"how much does Raffaella Ramsay owe me in salmon collective\", \"wait quick one, show me the pics i took recently\", \"diff thing, whos invited to the chiropodist\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0030\", \"v\": [[\"I've got a free afternoon and want to knock a few things off, so what haven't I done yet?\", \"Some of those feel less urgent — which of them don't have a due date?\", \"Different thing, I found an old picture and can't remember — who's in the carrom photo?\", \"Oh, I actually messaged them today, so could you log that?\", \"One more, I'm trying to settle my accounts — do I owe Rohit Horak anything?\"], [\"what havent i done yet\", \"which of those have no due date\", \"diff thing, whos in the carrom photo\", \"i messaged them today, log it\", \"do i owe Rohit Horak anything\"]]}","ttft_ms":32798,"type":"result","duration_ms":49135,"uuid":"dbfa5c1e-f16f-4807-8a93-155de17d0ca7","ttft_stream_ms":1429,"time_